pub const LESSON_GOALS : [33]str = [
    "What an FPGA is made of, and why a design uses only part of the chip.",
    "How a chip names itself in 32 bits, and how to read those bits.",
    "How the signals of your design reach the outside world.",
    "How a number is stored in bits, and how balanced ternary stores it in trits.",
