    "What a t27 spec looks like, and what the compiler does with it in your browser.",
    "Why every t27 spec carries its own tests, and what a waveform shows.",
    "Why green checks are not proof, and how to catch code that compiles and is wrong.",
    "The path a spec takes inside t27c: tokens, syntax tree, types, HIR, code.",
